# The design system is published to the public npm registry, not to GitHub
# Packages. This line is not redundant: a developer with an `@shaharia-lab`
# scope mapping in their own ~/.npmrc (which is how the org's private packages
# are consumed elsewhere) otherwise resolves @shaharia-lab/agento-code against
# npm.pkg.github.com and gets a 404 that reads as "this package does not
# exist". Stating the registry here makes the install work the same on every
# machine and on the runner.
@shaharia-lab:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
